# Generated testOS cloud-safe fixtures are NOT committed because they embed
# the current commit SHA and a generated_at timestamp that go stale on every
# commit. The 'good' fixture is regenerated on demand by generate-fixtures.py
# for manual `validate-testos-evidence.py --fixtures` runs.
#
# The authoritative cloud-safe regression suite is
# tools/test-cloud-safe-livedev.py, which builds fixtures dynamically in temp
# directories using the real repo commit/VERSION/hashes. That file is what CI
# runs (via `python3 -m pytest tools/test-*.py -q`).
good/
